; DESERT.EX2: the game of Battle Isle's first data disk, started by
; DESERT.EXE. Its code is BATTLE.EXE's byte for byte, with the same
; relocations (compared: only 3 bytes of far data differ, in F2789 and
; F27EE); its file ends in DATA, before the stack (the header's minimum
; allocation covers the rest). The hints are BATTLE.hints' carried over
; by doskit/tools/xfer.py (the block below the marker).
; Hints for doskit/tools/disasm.py; numbers are hex.

exe DESERT/DESERT.EX2

; the segments: the same frames as BATTLE.EXE's (from the relocations and
; the header, SS:SP = 2F32:0080)
